OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on BBC One's COW
OL,4,Cera on its 40th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe know the devices were all installed
OL,7,Fbefore Christmas 1984 ready for a
OL,8,FJanuary start but the COW's
OL,9,Fintroduction was delayed until the new
OL,10,Flook schedule began in February.
OL,12,FSo given all this effort it is
OL,13,Fsurprising that a few inconsistencies
OL,14,Facross the network crept in.
OL,16,FMost obviously, there was the issue of
OL,17,Fhow to promote Ceefax subtitles.
OL,23,APub: 16-Feb-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12904
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F129A1772999459
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on BBC One's COW
OL,4,Cera on its 40th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe network COW had an elegant caption
OL,7,Fwhich could be switched on and off as
OL,8,Frequired. It fitted the image
OL,9,Fbeautifully.
OL,11,FBut the nations were left to find their
OL,12,Fown solutions.
OL,14,FTheir Astons promoting subtitles were
OL,15,Finconsistent and sometimes looked
OL,16,Fclunky against the elegant ident.
OL,18,FCould a design solution not have been
OL,19,Ffound to provide a bespoke solution for
OL,20,Fthe nations?
OL,23,APub: 16-Feb-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,130,120,200,300,0,100
